#: ../../source/sop.rst:2 53e3dbd1fe6840f79d68214b372704ff
msgid "_`Outer-loop self-tuning`"
msgstr ""
"_`外环自整定`"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:4 b8ac81a0edc846da8437dbc115695c80
msgid ""
"This page is the standard operating procedure for one process-shaped "
"capability: tuning a speed loop on a machine the library has never seen. "
"It is not a tutorial on how to tune a motor. It is the answer to two "
"other questions -- **what makes this procedure valid on the next "
"machine**, and **when it must refuse to hand back a number** -- and it is"
" written down because a procedure that exists only in someone's habits "
"cannot be replayed, reviewed, or contradicted."
msgstr ""
"本页是一项流程型能力的标准作业规程：在一台本库从未见过的电机上整定速度环"
"。它不是如何调电机的教程。它回答的是另外两个问题—— **这个规程凭什么在下"
"一台电机上仍然成立** ，以及 **它什么时候必须拒绝交出一个数字** ——之所以"
"写下来，是因为只存在于某个人习惯里的规程无法重放、无法评审，也无法被反驳"
"。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:11 837ad641d0db42829eb4f9c313d5b1a1
msgid ""
"The executable form of everything below is "
"``test_package/test/unit/test_sop_outer_loop.cpp``, with the shared "
"measurement bench in ``sil_sop_bench.hpp``. Where this page and that "
"driver disagree, the driver is right and the page is a bug."
msgstr ""
"下面全部内容可执行的形式是 ``"
"test_package/test/unit/test_sop_outer_loop.cpp`` ，共享的测量台架在 ``"
"sil_sop_bench.hpp`` 。本页与该驱动不一致时，以驱动为准，本页是缺陷。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:17 a87f8b924bd645f19f7499871e711708
msgid "Why a procedure rather than an instance"
msgstr ""
"为何写规程而不是写实例"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:19 d526e2b0a8a84812aa29b6a21ba6f1a0
msgid ""
"The library cannot ship gains for your machine, and shipping a table of "
"gains for *one* machine would be worse than shipping none: it would look "
"like coverage. What it can ship is a sequence of steps in which every "
"number comes from the machine in front of you, plus the refusal semantics"
" for the case where the data does not describe that machine at all."
msgstr ""
"本库无法为使用者的电机附带增益，而附带一张只针对 *一台* 电机的增益表比不"
"附带更糟：那看起来像覆盖率。本库能附带的是一个步骤序列，其中每个数字都来"
"自眼前的这台电机，外加一种拒绝语义——数据完全不描述这台电机时该如何拒绝。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:26 7026bb245c6143909d8008ea0c34c3ca
msgid "Four phases, in one order"
msgstr ""
"四个阶段，一个顺序"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:32 3670ca8678534cd88810d81cbe3d8f1a
msgid "Phase"
msgstr ""
"阶段"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:33 c3ae6dcc224f4a29830eec942bdb954c
msgid "What happens"
msgstr ""
"具体内容"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:34 b84fe2d0819643b290a1f23cce21c61e
msgid "Library entry point"
msgstr ""
"库入口"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:35 426459acde95482dbbcc0ab726eec6ac
msgid "**identify**"
msgstr ""
"**辨识**"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:36 04115346a2b64e7797326c0f4456d342
msgid ""
"Run a current staircase on *this* machine and feed the drive's own ``(dt,"
" iq, omega)`` into an accumulator; identify the two ratios the speed loop"
" needs -- torque constant over inertia, and damping over inertia."
msgstr ""
"在 *这台* 电机上跑一段电流阶梯，把驱动器自己的 ``(dt, iq, omega)`` 喂进"
"累加器；辨识速度环需要的两个比值——转矩常数与惯量之比、阻尼与惯量之比。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:39 89f682ef5a1748a0a1adc66419e6414d
msgid "``SpeedTuner::accumulate()``, ``SpeedTuner::finish()``"
msgstr ""
"``SpeedTuner::accumulate()`` 、 ``SpeedTuner::finish()`` （累加与收尾）"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:40 68467a1670b045afb5d2bec902a4ccde
msgid "**propose**"
msgstr ""
"**提出**"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:41 65b2091a7e814be79852138ff8484058
msgid ""
"Turn the ratios into gains with the same law the shipped configuration "
"uses, so a tuned loop and a configured loop are the same kind of object."
msgstr ""
"按出货配置所用的同一条律把比值换成增益，使整定得到的环与配置得到的环属于"
"同一类对象。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:43 b6cb9acd2591483383a813696aca8a33
msgid "``SpeedTuneResult::kp_a_per_rad_s``, ``ki_a_per_rad_s2``"
msgstr ""
"``SpeedTuneResult::kp_a_per_rad_s`` 、 ``ki_a_per_rad_s2`` （比例与积分"
"增益）"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:44 fe638e2c7e804f73b1aa17ea799c020d
msgid "**measure**"
msgstr ""
"**测量**"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:45 42d21a4f3f80455ebc7d32170d3b9cb3
msgid ""
"Under those gains, *measure* the closed-loop -3 dB point (sine injection "
"plus bisection) and report the delivered ratio: measured over requested."
msgstr ""
"在该组增益下， *测量* 闭环的 -3 dB 点（正弦注入加二分法），并报告交付比"
"：实测值比请求值。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:47 8a33f4f28ad7449580e8fa669b798950
msgid "``sil_sop_bench.hpp::minus3db_over_requested()``"
msgstr ""
"``sil_sop_bench.hpp::minus3db_over_requested()`` （交付比测量函数）"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:48 ae67a1075fdb4a1ba4f77d2dda0415bc
msgid "**accept or refuse**"
msgstr ""
"**接受或拒绝**"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:49 dd4263e9da85437f8e8a7546dd1a187c
msgid ""
"Accept when the delivered ratio lands inside the band; report ``valid == "
"false`` with a reason and **no usable gains** otherwise."
msgstr ""
"交付比落在带内则接受；否则报告 ``valid == false`` ，并给出原因与 **无可"
"用增益** 。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:51 df02607621fd41db86ee39b9660d0a17
msgid "``SpeedTuneResult::valid``, ``.reason``, ``.tolerance``"
msgstr ""
"``SpeedTuneResult::valid`` 、 ``.reason`` 、 ``.tolerance`` （判定、原因"
"、容差）"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:53 2e426053a452437f909a6dc5a57cbcc8
msgid ""
"**The order is not a style choice.** Proposing before measuring is "
"accepting your own model with your own model; measuring before proposing "
"lets the criterion drift with the measurement. What makes the sequence "
"legitimate is that the proposal uses only this machine's data while the "
"acceptance test is applied where the machine is not the one that produced"
" the gains -- see the replay criterion below."
msgstr ""
"**这个顺序不是风格选择。** 先提出再测量，等于用自己的模型验收自己的模型"
"；先测量再提出，判据会随测量一起漂。这个次序之所以成立，在于提议只用这台"
"电机的数据，而验收测试施加在不是产生这组增益的那台电机上——见下文的复现判"
"据。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:60 d5c5449c881e42c6bda1e1733e4b79f8
msgid "The three criteria, and what each one can falsify"
msgstr ""
"三条判据，以及每条能证伪什么"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:62 f214b15039f34154a40ef40097338f2a
msgid ""
"**1. The procedure replays on a second machine, and the criterion moves "
"with it.** Tune on machine A, apply to machine B, and the delivered ratio"
" leaves the band; tune on B and apply to B and it is back inside. The "
"gains themselves scale with the machine's own ratio, which is the check "
"that the procedure read the machine rather than memorising a number. The "
"falsifying run: replace B with a copy of A and both the strict inequality"
" and the gain ratio go red at once. A criterion that cannot be made red "
"is a criterion that is not testing anything."
msgstr ""
"**1. 规程能在第二台电机上复现，判据随之移动。** 在 A 机上整定、施加到 B"
"机，交付比离开带内；在 B 机上整定、施加到 B 机，它又回到带内。增益本身随"
"机自身的比值缩放，这就是“规程读的是电机、而不是背下一个数字”的检查。证伪"
"实验：把 B 换成 A 的一份拷贝，严格不等式与增益比会同时变红。无法变红的判"
"据，就是没有在检验任何东西的判据。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:70 f6ea2520fdeb426b9f53ad3613eb8b8a
msgid ""
"**2. Data that does not describe this machine yields no number.** On a "
"machine far outside the plausible range the result is ``valid == false`` "
"with a non-empty reason, and the gains handed back are *bit for bit* the "
"nameplate ones the caller would have used anyway -- so a caller that "
"applies whatever it is given changes nothing. The measured ratio is still"
" reported, and it is reported as a statement **about the measurement**, "
"not as a gain."
msgstr ""
"**2. 不描述这台电机的数据给不出数字。** 对一台远在合理范围之外的电机，结"
"果是 ``valid == false`` ，并带有非空的原因；交回的增益与调用方本来就会用"
"的铭牌增益 *逐位相同* ——所以拿到什么就施加什么的调用方，什么都没改变。实"
"测比仍然报告，但它是关于 **测量** 的陈述，而不是增益。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:77 7934970071fe422d870e89e87ceb944f
msgid ""
"**3. The objective is distance to failure, not smallness of error.** The "
"search maximises the margin between the identified ratio and the edge of "
"the acceptance band, and that margin crosses zero exactly where the "
"library's own refusal starts. An objective written as \"smaller "
"residual\" would be a different quantity with a different winner: on the "
"outer loop's own grid the smallest residual and the best held-out margin "
"are not achieved by the same setting, and the residual wins on the wrong "
"side. That is the argument for the margin, and it is measurable rather "
"than aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"**3. 目标是到失败的距离，而不是误差之小。** 搜索最大化的是辨识比与验收带"
"边缘之间的余量，而这个余量恰好在库自身的拒绝开始处过零。写成“残差更小”的"
"目标是另一个量，胜出者也不同：在外环自己的网格上，最小残差与最好的留出集"
"余量不由同一组设置取得，而残差胜在错误的一侧。这就是采用余量的理由，并且"
"它是可度量的，不是审美。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:87 8a5061181b9449709b4a0eb279b03370
msgid "Where the acceptance band comes from"
msgstr ""
"验收带的来源"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:89 572a43d631f543d4a7afab22690b8aad
msgid ""
"The band's upper edge is the geometric mean of two measured quantities, "
"and neither of them is chosen by taste:"
msgstr ""
"带的上边缘是两个实测量值的几何平均，两者都不是凭口味选的："

#: ../../source/sop.rst:92 e2ebb8ceb3be4d40b7b4d1a09999c9cf
msgid ""
"the largest residual the gain law itself leaves across a decade of "
"bandwidth (measured in the motor configuration's own cases), because a "
"band narrower than the law's own spread would fail a correctly identified"
" loop;"
msgstr ""
"增益律本身在一个十倍带宽范围内留下的最大残差（在电机配置自己的用例中测得"
"），因为比该律自身散布更窄的带会把一个辨识正确的环判为不合格；"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:95 1ebaa32d36ec436ba7b45a623579941e
msgid ""
"the smallest nameplate error this repository already treats as "
"operational (the inertia tolerance), because a band wider than that would"
" pass a machine nobody has described."
msgstr ""
"本仓库已经当作可投运处理的最小铭牌误差（惯量容差），因为比它更宽的带会放"
"行一台没人描述过的电机。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:99 7e2250272ec34300b6868b35601b0b17
msgid ""
"Both factors and their product live in the claim row for "
"``core/auto_tune.hpp``. **``tolerance`` itself is the caller's number**, "
"not a measured bound: ``valid`` is judged against whatever the caller "
"passed, so a caller who widens it owns the consequence. And the delivered"
" bandwidth is **not** 1.0 by construction -- the band accepts *this law*,"
" not \"unity\"."
msgstr ""
"两个因子及其乘积都记在 ``core/auto_tune.hpp`` 的主张行里。 **``tolerance"
"`` 本身是调用方的数字** ，不是测出来的界： ``valid`` 是拿调用方传进来的"
"值判定，所以把它放宽的调用方自己承担后果。并且交付带宽在构造上 **不是** "
"1.0——带接受的是 *这条律* ，不是“单位增益”。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:106 bd83cb87f4ea4576b61c5162a65a4ba5
msgid "The second cut: search process parameters only"
msgstr ""
"第二处切分：只搜索过程参数"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:108 03b3bc6f0b8048b29a5a2d2bd1fd28a5
msgid ""
"A hyper-parameter search over this procedure is only meaningful if the "
"things being searched actually move the result, and that has to be "
"checked before it is searched, not after. Two facts from that check:"
msgstr ""
"对本规程做超参数搜索，只有在被搜索的东西确实会移动结果时才有意义，而这一"
"点必须在搜索之前核对，不在之后。该核对给出两个事实："

#: ../../source/sop.rst:112 0d1ab5eb29ce4a619a746b40aec5a570
msgid ""
"**The window length is a real parameter, and residual and margin disagree"
" about it.** The best residual is not the best held-out margin; the two "
"orderings differ, which is the whole reason criterion 3 exists. The "
"difference is small on a clean two-parameter plant and the point is the "
"ordering, not the magnitude."
msgstr ""
"**窗长是真正的参数，残差与余量对它并不一致。** 最好的残差不是最好的留出"
"余量；两种排序不同，这正是判据 3 存在的全部理由。在一个干净的两参数被控"
"对象上差别很小，重点在排序，不在幅度。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:116 50da276d354a4e50b15a79070dcce8d9
msgid ""
"**The injection amplitude is not a parameter at all.** Scaling it leaves "
"the identified ratio unchanged, because the fit is scale invariant. "
"Searching it walks a flat objective, and a flat objective makes any "
"sampler look patient."
msgstr ""
"**注入幅值根本不是参数。** 对它缩放不改变辨识出的比，因为拟合是尺度不变"
"的。搜索它等于在一个平坦的目标上游走，而平坦的目标会让任何采样器都显得很"
"有耐心。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:120 2f1c4fca59b242bdaa9b14a9d0036654
msgid ""
"A deterministic grid is used deliberately. The criterion is a margin on a"
" held-out set; a grid makes the ranking reversal reproducible and CI-"
"able, and swapping in a sampler that draws from a distribution would not "
"change a single conclusion."
msgstr ""
"这里刻意采用确定性网格。判据是留出集上的余量；网格让排序反转可复现、可进"
"CI，换成从分布中抽样的采样器不会改变任何一条结论。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:125 48e2add0fafd4befaabd65d8935de7f1
msgid "What this procedure does not claim"
msgstr ""
"本规程不主张什么"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:127 26f8278dfded41e7b3cb1677f8bd3d1a
msgid ""
"**Only the outer loop.** The current loop is assumed fast and is not "
"identified."
msgstr ""
"**只涉及外环。** 电流环被假定足够快，不做辨识。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:128 844a379847ed4656a9dc87e01ec6c5a4
msgid ""
"**``tolerance`` is not a measured bound.** It is the caller's acceptance "
"number (see above)."
msgstr ""
"**``tolerance`` 不是测出来的界。** 它是调用方的验收数字（见上）。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:130 6fcc614f94fb4d189920b008b4ff92b1
msgid ""
"**The delivered bandwidth is not unity.** The law is what the band "
"accepts."
msgstr ""
"**交付带宽不是单位增益。** 带接受的就是这条律。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:131 f407b42bc7ec4ba69dcfbf1af6e84f16
msgid ""
"**Not the sensorless low-speed case.** That capability's replay needs a "
"bench that can be moved to a second machine (changing flux linkage or "
"dead time moves its floor with them), and until that bench exists the "
"low-speed side has a **falsification** rather than a procedure: an early "
"estimate of its speed floor as a ratio of dead-time volts to flux linkage"
" was measured to be a lower bound, and a magnet change predicted to lower"
" it made the measured error worse at every speed. No page in this "
"documentation may present that number as a boundary."
msgstr ""
"**不涉及无感低速工况。** 那项能力的复现需要一个能搬到第二台电机上的台架"
"（改磁链或改死区会连带移动它的下限），在这样一个台架出现之前，低速这一侧"
"只有 **证伪** ，没有规程：早先按“死区伏秒与磁链之比”给出的转速下限估计，"
"实测为下界，而按预测能降低它的一次磁钢改动，使每个转速上的实测误差都变差"
"。本文档的任何一页都不得把那个数字当作边界。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:138 c6336949bd4d4c1daf4b5baf3a07f4c7
msgid ""
"**Not an optimiser.** The search is a grid over process parameters, and "
"its output is a setting, not a model of your machine."
msgstr ""
"**不是优化器。** 搜索是过程参数上的网格，其输出是一组设置，不是使用者的"
"电机的模型。"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:142 4153c8067dbf4ac7ac91391c903db930
msgid "Reproduce it"
msgstr ""
"复现方式"

#: ../../source/sop.rst:144 66ab469fe2804b1898ab0ce62162e6aa
msgid "The driver builds against the conan-cached gtest and runs standalone:"
msgstr ""
"该驱动对着 conan 缓存里的 gtest 构建，可独立运行："

#: ../../source/sop.rst:155 17edf41b45b3457c929faa9a032747d2
msgid ""
"It runs as part of ``ctest`` as well; the case count is in ``docs"
"/verification-numbers.json`` so this page does not have to carry it."
msgstr ""
"它也作为 ``ctest`` 的一部分运行；用例数记在 ``"
"docs/verification-numbers.json`` 里，本页不必再承载这个数字。"

